WcJY9Eu4VgkQ7kNvwHmvnvC&_nc_oc=AdrGtwozOdhPNZmHUBZeFQe4z7v0ZCakBAyRDtrXn4LxRwVsCtePkXpx8a0veuWlTIg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-UmbekIOkoNXjzrV2NLWG-iZLJqA5jzEHSVJka_Bwgng&oe=6A297137"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1PIjpOu1QMsQ7kNvwGDr7e2&_nc_oc=Adog3p98f8HjHHszhE9SnkY-6kazJtPCgOem7Rt4vor--Puz_PB4njv_7V3ElJdUnKg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_k6oDOGtgQqf3QMGKjfk8UTWnXD4bRMGeQeOMZ-ud1dg&oe=6A2972CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NIJqh3-Tkv0Q7kNvwEXkrp5&_nc_oc=Adr4Xj41cxtL74O-qh5kqDKL-zFd9ftHxbyWGlMhU2XXg1tVuTkgfz5COX9dzb_Pw9M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-628OizQqZgqtsm8UsS396e0mgiF-uZdMOSUezkEpq7A&oe=6A295FEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JL_i2kjND0UQ7kNvwFD3pLQ&_nc_oc=AdqL-xMlXhiMAQL5kmLXbdYv5QPvVCZ_Qpzbe4Um_Om73I5pPZssm7Tb5RrU3EkPRgM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Zy4Wy0BFpVwMVYKLXWkx2OhpDsFwLUlQy-w3o_XaNlA&oe=6A298183"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fmHyJ9W5hOgQ7kNvwFwrvHV&_nc_oc=AdpwYAY6qXS1mRtQxcNZKpC1DzhgEQcqMmoUNDQtQs3O_-1ftaPYzh7CScfQISNEN2M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8lp0shMshFzIqtc_nJTe-pchM0Oq7dzd6_lDqd5X6acg&oe=6A2979D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zTgI6TWvAM0Q7kNvwGSKQ62&_nc_oc=Adr-v-X1g_nZZDI9Fp0WFc5gFKjBhsm792yfUDx7VLHj3liwiehpSxZ2MeMgkCTQ6dA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8cOhZJ8W999b5cbKzAw2l6FTxfnp_NVpc4pr1weAzGCw&oe=6A2954BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080